cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Insider Threat and Risk Architecture (INTRA)"
abstract: >-
  A living, three level framework for building an insider risk management
  program in Europe:
  pillars, the measures under them, and the controls each European
  jurisdiction makes of those measures, each stated from a source that has
  been read.
